## Model Performance

- MAE: 200.55
- RMSE: 560.42
- R² Score: 0.1252

The model was successfully trained using Random Forest Regression.
The prediction accuracy was limited because the dataset contains only a small set of features.

## Key Findings

- Technology generated the highest sales and profit.
- West was the highest-performing region.
- Consumer was the top customer segment.
- Phones and Chairs were the top-selling sub-categories.
- Higher discounts reduced profitability.
- Binders, Tables, and Machines were major loss-making sub-categories.
